WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.260
Edit the manual confirmation step in the draft.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.797
Switch to a visual check and add a spatial relationship.

00:00:03.797 --> 00:00:06.884
Choose either hand for the first target.

00:00:06.884 --> 00:00:11.956
Select the toolbox for the second target.

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:14.317
Check that the relationship is Near.

